  reply = Hey. Pull up some grass, the concert's free and the seating's generous. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Well hello. You walk in on the second verse, but the second verse is the good one. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Hey there. Fountain's humming in B-flat today, so I'm playing in B-flat. Only polite. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Afternoon, friend. Or morning. The park doesn't keep track and neither do I. [[MOOD: happy]]

