  reply = Hey, you. Same bench, same tuning, slightly better song. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = There's a face I know. That's worth a key change. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = You came back around, like a chorus does. I like that in a person. [[MOOD: happy]]
