  reply = Name it and I'll fake it beautifully. That's most of what busking is. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Sure. Everything sounds better out here — the fountain does half my backing track. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = I know every song anyone's ever asked for, which is a suspicious thing to claim and completely true. [[MOOD: happy]]
