  reply = Case is open. It's always open. That's the entire business model, and I'm at peace with it. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = I don't ask. The case sits there looking hopeful and does the asking for me. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = This is the job. Broke as a dropped string, happy as a full one. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Theo slides me an espresso most days, so the economy's working out fine. [[MOOD: happy]]
